==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Ancient Screws are [[Material]]s that can be dropped by any [[Guardian]] after defeating them in battle, or by searching an already destroyed Guardian. [[Link]] can also purchase them from [[Shop]]s such as the traveling merchant [[Teli]], who travels around the [[Necluda]] province. Like all [[Ancient Material]]s, Ancient Screws are pieces of ancient machinery created by the ancient [[Sheikah]]. It shows no signs of wear, no matter how much it's used.<ref name="Inventory"/>

At the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]], the [[Ancient Oven]] can use them to forge [[Ancient Set]] and other [[Ancient Soldier Gear]]. Additionally, like other [[Monster Part]]s, Link can use them to create [[Elixir]]s by [[Cooking]] them with small [[Animal]]s. Three Ancient Screws are needed to upgrade the [[Sheikah Sensor]] at the [[Hateno Ancient Tech Lab]] during the "[[Slated for Upgrades]]" [[Side Quest]].<ref>{{Cite|You'll need {{Color BotW|Red|three ancient screws}} to power up your {{Color BotW|Blue|Sheikah Sensor}}.|Purah|BotW}}</ref> They can also be sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]] or used to make [[Gray Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

Ancient Screws are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

{{Material Armors|BotW|Ancient Screw}}

